{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中日關係緊張，日本已有逾半年沒有大熊貓。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">東京上野動物園的大熊貓館，將於明日開始拆除，不少大熊貓粉絲今日到場，告別只有大熊貓紙板的展館。上野動物園一月把雙胞胎大熊貓「曉曉」和「蕾蕾」送回中國後，日本處於「零熊貓」狀態。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.PANDA-2300_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026iGvifzBeA21786885796.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.PANDA-2300_002.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.PANDA-2300_005.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026pMKn81TmSS1786886536.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.PANDA-2300_005.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">園內的熊貓館於1988年落成，取代1973年啟用的第一代展館，曾有十隻大熊貓在那裡生活，有民眾稱希望日後可以再次在國內見到大熊貓。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.PANDA-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026G23z99ueH11786885565.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.PANDA-2300_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T13:38:45.743091+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}